rkdown-alert.markdown-alert-caution .markdown-alert-title {color: var(--fgColor-danger,var(--color-danger-fg));}</style>", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "验证 GitHub markdown 告警块渲染（generator 注入 ALERT_STYLES）。", "created_at": 1791201882, "created_date": "2026-10-05", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1791201882, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}, "P9": {"number": 9, "html_dir": "dist/post/9.html", "labels": ["随笔"], "post_title": "覆盖2：图片与 lightbox", "post_url": "post/9.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 127, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "验证图片渲染与点击放大。", "created_at": 1791201872, "created_date": "2026-10-05", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1791201872, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}, "P8": {"number": 8, "html_dir": "dist/post/8.html", "labels": ["技术"], "post_title": "覆盖1：代码高亮与复制按钮", "post_url": "post/8.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 196, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "多语言代码块验证语法高亮与 code-copy 按钮。", "created_at": 1791201794, "created_date": "2026-10-05", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1791201794, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}, "P6": {"number": 6, "html_dir": "dist/post/6.html", "labels": ["随笔"], "post_title": "测试B：front matter 与摘要", "post_url": "post/6.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 28, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "这篇走 front matter 的 description 字段", "created_at": 1791200983, "created_date": "2026-10-05", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1791200983, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}, "P3": {"number": 3, "html_dir": "dist/post/3.html", "labels": ["随笔", "技术"], "post_title": "第三篇测试：多标签文章", "post_url": "post/3.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 39, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "第三篇测试：多标签文章\n\n(触发一次自动构建验证 issues.edited)。", "created_at": 1790731470, "created_date": "2026-09-30", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1791200759, "updated_date": "2026-10-05"}}, "single_list": {"P4": {"number": 4, "html_dir": "dist/about.html", "labels": ["about"], "post_title": "关于", "post_url": "about.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 175, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "## 关于本站\n\n这是使用 [InterNote](https://github.com/interset-wq/InterNote) 搭建的个人博客，以 GitHub Issue 为写作入口。", "created_at": 1790732179, "created_date": "2026-09-30", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1790732179, "updated_date": "2026-09-30"}}, "render_cache": {"4ae4e346bc4747c4c78f048648248acb92293fc5a87382b79467d60455cb30e4": "<p>这篇带三个标签，验证多标签徽章、search-index 的 labels 数组与跨标签筛选。</p>", "dd3cbe3418b319854eb04526dc396e64314b071daf04e16cec10e088f1634332": "<p>这篇只改标题不改正文，验证 render cache 命中（构建日志应无 /markdown 调用、页面秒出）。</p>\n<p>初始正文内容。</p>", "90dc217eabff694232dcb5eda3911c0353fcb9a8f048d3f3ca447787865e1384": "<p>验证特殊字符与潜在注入都被转义。</p>\n&lt;script&gt;alert('xss')&lt;/script&gt;\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"x\"><img src=\"x\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p>HTML 实体：&lt;div&gt; &amp; \"quotes\"</p>\n<div>原生 HTML div</div>\n<p>特殊符号：&lt; &gt; &amp; \" ' ` -- ---</p>", "76d43d9fc5f8277c036c88b33ca23f41b7fac3bec6b33083f5a4e3cb035eb161": "<p>这篇有多个层级标题，验证 toc.js 目录生成与 scroll-spy。</p>\n<h2>二级标题甲</h2>\n<p>一些文字。</p>\n<h3>三级标题甲一</h3>\n<p>更多文字。</p>\n<h3>三级标题甲二</h3>\n<p>更多文字。</p>\n<h2>二级标题乙</h2>\n<p>结尾段落。</p>", "7c467ea3a2b2c9baf530085fcb60daf0e2d040850a1b60e1a7a94ff3f7ab2b43": "<p>验证 MathJax 行内与块级公式。</p>\n<p>行内：质能方程 <math-renderer class=\"js-inline-math\" style=\"display: inline-block\" data-run-id=\"7eae16c07e2e0475edb1ff5beba6dfaf\">$E = mc^2$</math-renderer>。</p>\n<p>块级：</p>\n<p><math-renderer class=\"js-display-math\" style=\"display: block\" data-run-id=\"7eae16c07e2e0475edb1ff5beba6dfaf\">$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} e^{-x^2} , dx = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$</math-renderer></p>", "8d4a30f619fe8b0cef63bb25fc5aa6c706cfe697646673f422ac48456ae53ef0": "<p>验证任务列表与表格渲染。</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> 已完成项</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> 未完成项</li>\n</ul>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列A</th>\n<th>列B</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>甲</td>\n<td>乙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丙</td>\n<td>丁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>", "cfccd6a2612d02972b4dd10188615f68a1e49ab4efdbf8393019ef33edd96151": "<p>验证 GitHub markdown 告警块渲染（generator 注入 ALERT_STYLES）。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p>这是 NOTE 告警。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-alert mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.698 13.132a.25.25 0 0 0 .22.368h12.164a.25.25 0 0 0 .22-.368Zm.53 3.996v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 11a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z\"></path></svg>Warning</p><p>这是 WARNING 告警。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-caution\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-stop mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.47.22A.749.749 0 0 1 5 0h6c.199 0 .389.079.53.22l4.25 4.25c.141.14.22.331.22.53v6a.749.749 0 0 1-.22.53l-4.25 4.25A.749.749 0 0 1 11 16H5a.749.749 0 0 1-.53-.22L.22 11.53A.749.749 0 0 1 0 11V5c0-.199.079-.389.22-.53Zm.84 1.28L1.5 5.31v5.38l3.81 3.81h5.38l3.81-3.81V5.31L10.69 1.5ZM8 4a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 8 4Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Caution</p><p>这是 CAUTION 告警。</p>\n</div>", "3819fe0d5a6ef3db7df86dac90403f4ca756fff2a6310a9966d7fb1cc390ac37": "<p>验证图片渲染与点击放大。</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/617169e529ae1e4322baf6482579a23d41dc82661c1d47845c0e90bfe2085ed9/68747470733a2f2f6769746875622e6769746875626173736574732e636f6d2f696d616765732f6d6f64756c65732f6c6f676f735f706167652f4769744875622d4d61726b2e706e67\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/617169e529ae1e4322baf6482579a23d41dc82661c1d47845c0e90bfe2085ed9/68747470733a2f2f6769746875622e6769746875626173736574732e636f6d2f696d616765732f6d6f64756c65732f6c6f676f735f706167652f4769744875622d4d61726b2e706e67\" alt=\"GitHub 标志\" data-canonical-src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/images/modules/logos_page/GitHub-Mark.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p>上面是外链图片，点击应打开 lightbox。</p>", "27df1159120f47f4bae250a756c9f2f7f926f7c09b054de0e3e0326db2aa9fc2": "<p>多语言代码块验证语法高亮与 code-copy 按钮。</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-python\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">def</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">fib</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">n</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">int</span>) <span class=\"pl-c1\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">int</span>:\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">n</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">n</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">2</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">else</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">fib</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">n</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>) <span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">fib</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">n</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">2</span>)</pre></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">greet</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">name</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">`hello <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">name</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>`</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span></pre></div>\n<p>行内代码 <code class=\"notranslate\">printf(\"hi\")</code>。</p>", "732c5ac0060276a672f9437927efd21597fbb38f89875805f7c4311e3f01a645": "<p>正文内容用于验证 front matter 摘要生效。</p>", "f2d8d0d0f412324a687093523ea96bb19dd17a15e5c83e08856f1bbb3d8d5977": "<p>第三篇测试：多标签文章</p>\n<p>(触发一次自动构建验证 issues.edited)</p>", "71653a722ba4c841ed53ad31108a4d3f0334d8c595ad83c9d30493da8f24ca52": "<h2>关于本站</h2>\n<p>这是使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/interset-wq/InterNote\">InterNote</a> 搭建的个人博客，以 GitHub Issue 为写作入口。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文章即 Issue，推送即发布</li>\n<li>评论由 giscus 提供（基于 GitHub Discussions）</li>\n<li>本站于 2026-09-30 建站</li>\n</ul>"}}